                           jefinho fófó\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"record-cell due\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-2-1-6\" data-name=\"due date cell\" role=\"cell\">\n                                <span class=\"mobile-label\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-2-1-6-1\" data-name=\"mobile due date label\">\n                                    Prazo\n                                </span>\n                                <div class=\"due-value\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-2-1-6-2\" data-name=\"due date value text\">\n                                    09/12/2026\n                                    <span data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-2-1-6-2-1\" data-name=\"due date type label\">\n                                        Prazo desejado\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"timeline-row\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-2-2\" data-name=\"urgent occurrence timeline row\">\n                            <span class=\"timeline-label\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"timeline label\">\n                                Histórico de andamento\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"timeline-track\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"timeline track line\">\n                                <span class=\"timeline-event\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"timeline status event\">\n                                    Aberta\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"timeline-time\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"timeline status time\">\n                                    18/09/2026 · 11:33:01\n                                </span>\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"history-note\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"history note text\">\n                                Registro inicial\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                    <article aria-label=\"Inspeção hidráulica de prioridade normal\" class=\"record-group\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-3\" data-name=\"normal occurrence row group\" role=\"rowgroup\">\n                        <div class=\"record-row\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-3-1\" data-name=\"normal occurrence details row\" role=\"row\">\n                            <div class=\"record-cell issue\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"issue description cell\" role=\"cell\">\n                                <span class=\"mobile-label\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"mobile occurrence label\">\n                                    Ocorrência\n                                </span>\n                                <div class=\"issue-category\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"issue category text\">\n                                    Hidráulica\n                                </div>\n                                <p class=\"issue-description\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-3-1-1-3\" data-name=\"issue description text\">\n                                    inspeção preventiva realizada. sem ocorrencias\n                                </p>\n                                <p class=\"issue-location\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-3-1-1-4\" data-name=\"issue location text\">\n                                    casa da mae joana , numero 345, bairro cavalada, ararangua- SC\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"record-cell registered\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"registered date cell\" role=\"cell\">\n                                <span class=\"mobile-label\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"mobile registered label\">\n                                    Registrada\n                                </span>\n                                <div class=\"date-value\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"date value text\">\n                                    18/09/2026\n                                    <span data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-3-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"time value text\">\n                                        11:30:54\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"record-cell priority\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-3-1-3\" data-name=\"priority cell\" role=\"cell\">\n                                <span class=\"mobile-label\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-3-1-3-1\" data-name=\"mobile priority label\">\n                                    Prioridade\n                                </span>\n                                <div class=\"priority-value normal\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-3-1-3-2\" data-name=\"priority status value\">\n                                    <span class=\"priority-dot normal\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-3-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"normal priority indicator dot\">\n                                    </span>\n                                    Normal\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"record-cell status\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-3-1-4\" data-name=\"status cell\" role=\"cell\">\n                                <span class=\"mobile-label\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-3-1-4-1\" data-name=\"mobile status label\">\n                                    Andamento\n                                </span>\n                                <label class=\"sr-only\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-3-1-4-2\" data-name=\"status selection hidden label\" for=\"status-normal\">\n                                    Atualizar andamento da inspeção hidráulica\n                                </label>\n                                <select class=\"status-select\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-4-1-3-1-4-3\" data-name=\"st