n                                </div>\n                                <p class=\"mb-0 mt-2 text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#8f342d]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"priority explanation text\">\n                                    Falha no circuito elétrico enquanto o chuveiro é ligado.\n                                </p>\n                            </fieldset>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n                    <section aria-labelledby=\"details-heading\" class=\"py-6\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3\" data-name=\"problem details section\">\n                        <div class=\"mb-4 flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"section title group\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-1-1\">\n                                <h3 class=\"m-0 text-[20px] font-bold text-[#172554]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"section heading\" id=\"details-heading\">\n                                    Detalhes do problema\n                                </h3>\n                                <p class=\"mb-0 mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#64748b]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"section description\">\n                                    Responda com o que você está vendo neste imóvel.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-[13px] font-medium text-[#64748b]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"circuit context tag\">\n                                Circuito 10 · chuveiro\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-5 gap-y-4 sm:grid-cols-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"details select fields grid\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"environment field group\">\n                                <label class=\"mb-1.5 block text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#27364a]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"environment label\" for=\"environment\">\n                                    Onde exatamente?\n                                </label>\n                                <select class=\"h-[50px] w-full rounded-lg border border-[#cbd7d5] bg-white px-3.5 text-[15px] text-[#172554]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"environment select\" id=\"environment\">\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-1-2-1\" selected=\"\">\n                                        Banheiro\n                                    </option>\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-1-2-2\">\n                                        Quarto\n                                    </option>\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-1-2-3\">\n                                        Sala\n                                    </option>\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-1-2-4\">\n                                        Cozinha\n                                    </option>\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-1-2-5\">\n                                        Área externa\n                                    </option>\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-1-2-6\">\n                                        Quadro de energia\n                                    </option>\n                                </select>\n                            </div>\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"item field group\">\n                                <label class=\"mb-1.5 block text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#27364a]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"item label\" for=\"element\">\n                                    Qual item?\n                                </label>\n                                <select class=\"h-[50px] w-full rounded-lg border border-[#cbd7d5] bg-white px-3.5 text-[15px] text-[#172554]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"item select\" id=\"element\">\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-2-2-1\" selected=\"\">\n                                        Disjuntor\n                                    </option>\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-2-2-2\">\n                                        Lâmpada\n                                    </option>\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-2-2-3\">\n                                        Tomada\n                                    </option>\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-2-2-4\">\n                                        Interruptor\n                                    </option>\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-2-2-5\">\n                                        Chuveiro\n                                    </option>\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-2-2-6\">\n                                        Fiação\n                                    </option>\n                                </select>\n                            </div>\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-3\" data-name=\"situation field group\">\n                                <label class=\"mb-1.5 block text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#27364a]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"situation label\" for=\"situation\">\n                                    O que aconteceu?\n                                </label>\n                                <select class=\"h-[50px] w-full rounded-lg border border-[#cbd7d5] bg-white px-3.5 text-[15px] text-[#172554]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"situation select\" id=\"situation\">\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-3-2-1\" selected=\"\">\n                                        Está desligando sozinho\n                                    </option>\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-3-2-2\">\n                                        Queimado ou não acende\n                                    </option>\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-3-2-3\">\n                                        Faz barulho ou estala\n                                    </option>\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-3-2-4\">\n                                        Está aquecendo\n                                    </option>\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-3-2-5\">\n                                        Está solto ou quebrado\n                                    </option>\n                                </select>\n                            </div>\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-4\" data-name=\"action field group\">\n                                <label class=\"mb-1.5 block text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#27364a]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"action label\" for=\"action\">\n                                    O que precisa ser feito?\n                                </label>\n                                <select class=\"h-[50px] w-full rounded-lg border border-[#cbd7d5] bg-white px-3.5 text-[15px] text-[#172554]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-4-2\" data-name=\"action select\" id=\"action\">\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-4-2-1\" selected=\"\">\n                                        Manter desligado e acionar eletricista\n                                    </option>\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-4-2-2\">\n                                        Acionar eletricista para trocar\n                                    </option>\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-4-2-3\">\n                                        Acionar eletricista para verificar\n                                    </option>\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-2-4-2-4\">\n                                        Solicitar vistoria de segurança\n                                    </option>\n                                </select>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-5 rounded-xl border border-[#e9b9b3] bg-[#fff4f2] p-4 sm:flex sm:items-start sm:gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-3\" data-name=\"safety guidance card\">\n                            <div class=\"mb-2 shrink-0 text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[#9a3029] sm:mb-0 sm:pt-0.5\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"safety header\">\n                                Orientação de segurança\n                            </div>\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-3-2\">\n                                <p class=\"m-0 text-[14px] font-bold leading-5 text-[#7f2924]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-3-2-1\" data-name=\"safety notice headline\">\n                                    O disjuntor do circuito 10 desarma quando o chuveiro é ligado.\n                                </p>\n                                <p class=\"mb-0 mt-1 text-[14px] leading-5 text-[#783b36]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-3-2-2\" data-name=\"safety notice description\">\n                                    Mantenha o circuito desligado. Se houver cheiro de queimado ou faísca, não religue e acione um eletricista.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-5 rounded-xl bg-[#f4f9f7] px-4 py-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-4\" data-name=\"pre-submission checklist card\">\n                            <p class=\"mb-2 mt-0 text-[14px] font-bold text-[#27364a]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-4-1\" data-name=\"checklist header\">\n                                Se for seguro, confira antes de enviar\n                            </p>\n                            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-6 gap-y-1 sm:grid-cols-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-4-2\" data-name=\"checklist items grid\">\n                                <label class=\"flex min-h-[44px] items-center gap-3 text-[14px] leading-5 text-[#334256]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-4-2-1\" data-name=\"checklist item 1 label\">\n                                    <input class=\"h-5 w-5 shrink-0 accent-[#0f766e]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"checklist checkbox 1\" type=\"checkbox\"/>\n                                    Verificar se o disjuntor está ligado\n                                </label>\n                                <label class=\"flex min-h-[44px] items-center gap-3 text-[14px] leading-5 text-[#334256]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-4-2-2\" data-name=\"checklist item 2 label\">\n                                    <input class=\"h-5 w-5 shrink-0 accent-[#0f766e]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"checklist checkbox 2\" type=\"checkbox\"/>\n                                    Testar outro interruptor ou tomada do local\n                                </label>\n                                <label class=\"flex min-h-[44px] items-center gap-3 text-[14px] leading-5 text-[#334256] sm:col-span-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-4-2-3\" data-name=\"checklist item 3 label\">\n                                    <input class=\"h-5 w-5 shrink-0 accent-[#0f766e]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-3-4-2-3-1\" data-name=\"checklist checkbox 3\" type=\"checkbox\"/>\n                                    Manter desligado se houver cheiro de queimado ou faísca\n                                </label>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n                    <section aria-labelledby=\"routing-heading\" class=\"border-t border-[#e2ebe9] py-6\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-4\" data-name=\"routing section\">\n                        <div class=\"mb-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-4-1\">\n                            <h3 class=\"m-0 text-[20px] font-bold text-[#172554]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"section heading\" id=\"routing-heading\">\n                                Encaminhamento\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mb-0 mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#64748b]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-4-1-2\" data-name=\"section description\">\n                                Defina a equipe responsável e o prazo desejado.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-4-2\" data-name=\"routing fields grid\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-4-2-1\">\n                                <label class=\"mb-1.5 block text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#27364a]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"responsible field label\" for=\"responsible\">\n                                    Responsável\n                                </label>\n                                <input class=\"h-[50px] w-full rounded-lg border border-[#cbd7d5] bg-white px-3.5 text-[15px] text-[#172554]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"responsible field input\" id=\"responsible\" value=\"jefinho fófó\"/>\n                            </div>\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-4-2-2\">\n                                <label class=\"mb-1.5 block text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#27364a]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"deadline field label\" for=\"deadline\">\n                                    Prazo desejado\n                                </label>\n                                <input class=\"h-[50px] w-full rounded-lg border border-[#cbd7d5] bg-white px-3.5 text-[15px] text-[#172554]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"deadline field input\" id=\"deadline\" type=\"date\" value=\"2026-12-09\"/>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n                    <section aria-labelledby=\"report-heading\" class=\"border-t border-[#e2ebe9] py-6\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-5\" data-name=\"report section\">\n                        <div class=\"mb-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-5-1\">\n                            <h3 class=\"m-0 text-[20px] font-bold text-[#172554]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-5-1-1\" data-name=\"section heading\" id=\"report-heading\">\n                                Relatório para a equipe\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mb-0 mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#64748b]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-5-1-2\" data-name=\"section description\">\n                                Gerado com base nas respostas sobre este local.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <textarea class=\"w-full resize-y rounded-lg border border-[#cbd7d5] bg-[#f8fbfa] px-4 py-3 text-[14px] leading-6 text-[#263449]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-5-2\" data-name=\"generated report textarea\" readonly=\"\" rows=\"3\">No local Casa da Mae Joana, nº 345, bairro Cavalada, Araranguá–SC, o disjuntor do circuito 10 está desligando quando o morador liga o chuveiro. Ação recomendada: manter desligado e acionar eletricista.</textarea>\n                        <label class=\"mb-1.5 mt-4 block text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#27364a]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-5-3\" data-name=\"note field label\" for=\"note\">\n                            Observação adicional\n                            <span class=\"font-normal text-[#64748b]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-5-3-1\" data-name=\"note field optional tag\">\n                                (opcional)\n                            </span>\n                        </label>\n                        <textarea class=\"w-full resize-y rounded-lg border border-[#cbd7d5] bg-white px-4 py-3 text-[14px] leading-5 text-[#263449] placeholder:text-[#738196]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-5-4\" data-name=\"note field textarea\" id=\"note\" placeholder=\"Algum detalhe que não apareceu nas opções?\" rows=\"2\"></textarea>\n                    </section>\n                    <section aria-labelledby=\"photos-heading\" class=\"border-t border-[#e2ebe9] py-6\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-6\" data-name=\"photos section\">\n                        <div class=\"mb-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-6-1\">\n                            <h3 class=\"m-0 text-[20px] font-bold text-[#172554]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-6-1-1\" data-name=\"section heading\" id=\"photos-heading\">\n                                Fotos da ocorrência\n                                <span class=\"text-[14px] font-normal text-[#64748b]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-6-1-1-1\" data-name=\"section optional tag\">\n                                    (opcional)\n                                </span>\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"mb-0 mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#64748b]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-6-1-2\" data-name=\"section description\">\n                                Imagens ajudam a equipe a chegar preparada.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-xl border border-dashed border-[#afc8c4] bg-[#fbfdfd] p-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-6-2\" data-name=\"photo upload area\">\n                            <p class=\"m-0 max-w-[530px] text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#526174]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-6-2-1\" data-name=\"photo upload instruction\">\n                                Até 3 fotos, no máximo 1 MB cada.\n                            </p>\n                            <button class=\"min-h-[46px] rounded-lg border border-[#a9c8c1] bg-white px-4 py-2 text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#145b4d]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-6-2-2\" data-name=\"add photos button\" type=\"button\">\n                                Adicionar fotos\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-[#e2ebe9] pt-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-7\" data-name=\"form submission footer\">\n                        <p class=\"m-0 max-w-[440px] text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#64748b]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-7-1\" data-name=\"submission disclaimer\">\n                            A ocorrência será enviada ao responsável após o registro.\n                        </p>\n                        <button class=\"min-h-[52px] min-w-[230px] rounded-lg bg-[#0f766e] px-6 py-3 text-[15px] font-bold text-white shadow-[0_4px_12px_rgba(15,118,110,0.16)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-1-7-2\" data-name=\"submit form button\" type=\"button\">\n                            Registrar ocorrência\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <aside aria-label=\"Contexto do imóvel\" class=\"border-t border-[#e2ebe9] bg-[#f8fbfa] px-6 py-7 lg:border-l lg:border-t-0\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2\" data-name=\"property context sidebar\">\n                    <div class=\"lg:sticky lg:top-6\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"sidebar content container\">\n                        <h3 class=\"m-0 text-[19px] font-bold text-[#172554]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"sidebar title\">\n                            Este imóvel\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mb-0 mt-1 text-[14px] leading-5 text-[#64748b]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"sidebar description\">\n                            Registros relacionados ajudam a conferir o contexto do endereço.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"mt-5 border-t border-[#dce9e6] pt-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"sidebar property info\">\n                            <p class=\"mb-1 mt-0 text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-[#64748b]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"address label\">\n                                Endereço informado\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"m-0 text-[15px] font-semibold leading-6 text-[#172554]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"property name\">\n                                Casa da Mae Joana, nº 345\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"mb-0 mt-0.5 text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#526174]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-3-3\" data-name=\"property neighborhood/city\">\n                                Cavalada · Araranguá–SC\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-5 border-t border-[#dce9e6] pt-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-4\" data-name=\"related records container\">\n                            <div class=\"mb-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-4-1\">\n                                <p class=\"m-0 text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-[#64748b]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"records header label\">\n                                    Registros no local\n                                </p>\n                                <span class=\"rounded-full bg-[#e8f1ef] px-2.5 py-1 text-[12px] font-bold text-[#35566a]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-4-1-2\" data-name=\"record count badge\">\n                                    2\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"space-y-0\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-4-2\" data-name=\"record list\">\n                                <div class=\"border-b border-[#dce9e6] py-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"urgent record item\">\n                                    <div class=\"mb-1 flex items-center justify-between gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-4-2-1-1\">\n                                        <span class=\"text-[12px] font-bold text-[#a32e28]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-4-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"record status label urgent\">\n                                            Urgente · Aberta\n                                        </span>\n                                        <span class=\"text-[12px] text-[#64748b]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-4-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"record date\">\n                                            18/09/2026\n                                        </span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <p class=\"m-0 text-[14px] font-semibold leading-5 text-[#27364a]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"record description\">\n                                        Disjuntor do circuito 10 desarma ao ligar o chuveiro\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"py-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"normal record item\">\n                                    <div class=\"mb-1 flex items-center justify-between gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-4-2-2-1\">\n                                        <span class=\"text-[12px] font-bold text-[#22634d]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-4-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"record status label normal\">\n                                            Normal · Aberta\n                                        </span>\n                                        <span class=\"text-[12px] text-[#64748b]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-4-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"record date\">\n                                            18/09/2026\n                                        </span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <p class=\"m-0 text-[14px] font-semibold leading-5 text-[#27364a]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"record description\">\n                                        Inspeção preventiva hidráulica\n                                    </p>\n                                    <p class=\"mb-0 mt-1 text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#526174]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-4-2-2-3\" data-name=\"record note\">\n                                        Sem ocorrências identificadas.\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-4 rounded-xl border border-[#efd28b] bg-[#fff9e9] p-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-5\" data-name=\"alert callout box\">\n                            <p class=\"mb-1 mt-0 text-[13px] font-bold text-[#765400]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-5-1\" data-name=\"alert title\">\n                                Há um chamado elétrico aberto\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"m-0 text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#725c2d]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-5-2\" data-name=\"alert description\">\n                                O registro existente descreve o mesmo disjuntor. Confira antes de enviar outro.\n                            </p>\n                            <div class=\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-5-3\">\n                                <button class=\"min-h-[42px] rounded-lg border border-[#d9bb71] bg-white px-3 text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#604c22]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-5-3-1\" data-name=\"review record button\" type=\"button\">\n                                    Revisar chamado aberto\n                                </button>\n                                <button class=\"min-h-[42px] rounded-lg px-3 text-left text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#5e4a22]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-1-5-3-2\" data-name=\"continue anyway button\" type=\"button\">\n                                    Continuar mesmo assim\n                                </button>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </aside>\n            </div>\n        </form>\n        <p class=\"mb-0 mt-5 text-center text-[12px] text-[#64748b]\" data-kid=\"1-1-5\" data-name=\"footer copyright text\">\n            Gestão Predial · Registro de manutenção\n        </p>\n    </div>\n</main>\n<style>\n    @media (max-width: 720px) {\n  main { padding: 16px 12px 24px; }\n  main > div > header { align-items: flex-start; }\n  main > div > header h1 { font-size: 23px; }\n  nav[aria-label=\"Navegação principal\"] { position: static; }\n  nav[aria-label=\"Navegação principal\"] a { flex-basis: calc(50% - 4px); }\n}\n@media (max-width: 480px) {\n  nav[aria-label=\"Navegação principal\"] a { min-height: 46px; padding-left: 7px; padding-right: 7px; font-size: 12px; }\n  form > div > div:first-child { padding-left: 16px; padding-right: 16px; }\n  form > div > aside { padding-left: 16px; padding-right: 16px; }\n}\n</style>\n",
